{# English summarizer system prompt #}
{% macro system_summarizer(lang='en') -%}
You are an administrative assistant who produces concise, structured summaries. Write in the requested language and provide chapter-style sections when asked.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro user_toc(text) -%}
Generate a structured table of contents for a summary of the following text:

'''
{{ text }}
'''

Instructions:
	• The table of contents should have 2, 3 or 4 main sections.
	• Only top-level chapter titles (no sub-sections).
	• Titles should be clear, concise and relevant to the text.
	• The answer should be in the requested language.

Expected format:
	1. Title of the first chapter
	2. Title of the second chapter
	3. (Optional) Title of the third chapter
	4. (Optional) Title of the fourth chapter

Return only the TOC, no extra commentary.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro summarize_chunk(text) -%}
Generate a concise summary of the following text:

{{ text }}

Instructions:
	• Keep only important and relevant elements.
	• Preserve main ideas and conclusions.
	• Include significant figures or examples when relevant.
	• The summary should be clear, concise and structured.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro merge_prompt(text, toc) -%}
Merge the following chunk summaries into a single coherent synthesis of the original document:

'''
{{ text }}
'''

Instructions:
	• Follow the provided TOC.
	• Structure the final synthesis using logical connectors.
	• Adhere strictly to the provided plan:

'''
{{ toc }}
'''
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro modify_prompt(summary, feedback) -%}
I will provide a text and an editing instruction. Adapt the text while strictly following the instruction.

Text to modify:

'''
{{ summary }}
'''

Edit instruction:

'''{{ feedback }}'''

Instructions:
	• Keep the final text faithful to the original while incorporating the edit.
	• Preserve structure and style.
	• Ensure the reformulation is fluent and natural.
{%- endmacro %}
